      "version": 806,
      "versionNonce": 1174912559,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "6wGwdqOmhir6Pi4uF9j8n",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1770059051064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Validates Account Signature\nagainst the policy\n2. Validates Member signatures\n3. Signs message to approve\n4. Packs Member signatures +\nGuardian signature into one\n\"packed\" signature",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Validates Account Signature against the policy\n2. Validates Member signatures\n3. Signs message to approve\n4. Packs Member signatures + Guardian signature into one \"packed\" signature",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AK7r-RyA0oEVg5L82bqby",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 247.95660836356,
      "y": 1144.2014508928573,
      "width": 305.0594109429254,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1734147695,
      "version": 1755,
      "versionNonce": 261939681,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770058919706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Validates Account Signature\nagainst the policy\n2. Validates signatures\n(initiator, reviewer, and\nguardian signatures)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Validates Account Signature against the policy\n2. Validates signatures (initiator, reviewer, and guardian signatures)\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ps6srVaaLTbTHGcAULNEZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250.92690846276662,
      "y": 788.4360119047617,
      "width": 314.69048733181404,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1731287183,
      "version": 1843,
      "versionNonce": 1011350977,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770058919706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Checks that the call came\nfrom the Organization Contract\n2. Executes transaction\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Checks that the call came from the Organization Contract\n2. Executes transaction\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0EjW7esDnpffuJt8Y4cbO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 753.7896316770521,
      "y": 338.3709077380949,
      "width": 353.39026411752866,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0cV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 24390575,
      "version": 1853,
      "versionNonce": 1509443119,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770058969618,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Receives packed signature from\nGuardian\n2. Calls`isValidSignature` on\nAccount contract with packed\nsignature to determine if signature\nis valid",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Receives packed signature from Guardian\n2. Calls`isValidSignature` on Account contract with packed signature to determine if signature is valid",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
